  "description": "Prebuilt success-only backlog; three repetitions with alternating order. Worker startup uses a shared gate; cleanup is disabled for full processing-latency coverage. Batch sweeps use a fixed 20,000-message backlog so BatchSize=1 fits the bounded drain; worker sweeps use 100,000. Do not compare throughput across different backlog sizes as the same experiment.",
